{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever dreamed of tying balloons to little toys and watching them gently lift into the sky? Well, now you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/4e5cf751708b4c9343ca86ccd2b3ca12.poster.avif?t=1761617872\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/4e5cf751708b4c9343ca86ccd2b3ca12.webm?t=1761617872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/4e5cf751708b4c9343ca86ccd2b3ca12.mp4?t=1761617872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unbox all kinds of balloons (hundreds of styles!), pick your favorite items\u2014a radio, a suitcase, a piano, even a car?!\u2014tie them down, send them floating, and then\u2026watch them burst into a spectacular reward!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/e2a0ac200163e14f1b4c91c1376274ab.poster.avif?t=1761617872\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/e2a0ac200163e14f1b4c91c1376274ab.webm?t=1761617872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/e2a0ac200163e14f1b4c91c1376274ab.mp4?t=1761617872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect, upgrade, and fill your balloon catalog while you turn everyday objects into floating surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/de131836d1a30cb5d478795557bdc6ec.poster.avif?t=1761617872\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/de131836d1a30cb5d478795557bdc6ec.webm?t=1761617872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/de131836d1a30cb5d478795557bdc6ec.mp4?t=1761617872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/b392a49b0fa5689d01b98541fddeb02c.poster.avif?t=1761617872\" width=640 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/b392a49b0fa5689d01b98541fddeb02c.webm?t=1761617872\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988370/extras/b392a49b0fa5689d01b98541fddeb02c.mp4?t=1761617872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready to float away?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Balloon Pioneer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3988370/e55fc962173d6cbe8046b3b0eccb3f05bd5b17e9.jpg"},{"name":"Balloon Researcher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3988370/638b2e2650f9bcc995110e732c60e355cc643933.jpg"},{"name":"Balloon Connoisseur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3988370/9fd868c1ad573f26cd62cdcca850113ee7bd7ed8.jpg"},{"name":"Balloon Fanatic","pat